OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer crushed by bales vows to
OL,4,Awalk unaided again
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farmer who was crushed beneath three
OL,7,Fhay bales said he was determined to
OL,8,Fwalk without a frame again after
OL,9,Fdoctors warned he may never do so.
OL,11,FWill Dickinson was working alone on his
OL,12,Fland at West End Farm, near Harpenden,
OL,13,FHertfordshire, on 20 June when his
OL,14,Ftrailer became unbalanced and the hay
OL,15,Fbales, weighing a combined 1,500kg (1.5
OL,16,Ftonnes), fell on him.
OL,18,FThe farmer suffered 12 broken ribs,
OL,19,Feight spinal fractures and a fractured
OL,20,Fpelvis, but managed to reach his mobile
OL,21,Fphone and call for help.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
