OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer crushed by bales vows to
OL,4,Awalk unaided again
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was told at the hospital there was a
OL,7,F75% chance I would never walk again,
OL,8,Fwhich was a huge shock," he said.
